### Root Cause Analysis

**Note 1a Requirement** (CAS2 Table 2.2 Note 1a):
> "This system is not required where: For risk group SM, if the escape routes serve no more than 10 beds..."

**Note 1a Evaluator Logic** (`note-1a-evaluator.js:31-42`):
```javascript
const bedCount = firecell.maxEscapeRouteBeds !== undefined
  ? firecell.maxEscapeRouteBeds
  : firecell.maxEscapeRouteOccupants;
// ❌ bedCount = undefined (both properties missing)

const bedExemption = typeof bedCount === 'number' && bedCount >= 0 && bedCount <= 10;
// ❌ bedExemption = false (undefined is not a number)

